NetSurf 3.11 (Debian 3.11-4 source, netsurf-all layout): redraw pages that scripts change.

A prototype, not a release: any DOM mutation after layout schedules a rebuild of the whole box tree
and a reflow (html__dom_changed, html_dom_relayout in html.c). Also fixes libdom's class cache on a
changed class attribute, adds the hidden attribute (UA rule and property) and input/change events
from form controls. See docs/research/BROWSERS.md section 5. Apply at the top of the source tree
with patch -p1.

